# Local Worker secrets for `wrangler dev` / `opennextjs-cloudflare preview`.
# Copy to .dev.vars (git-ignored). Every key is optional: the database is not
# here (the Worker reaches it through the HYPERDRIVE binding, wrangler.jsonc),
# and neither is the model — Workers AI answers through the AI binding.
#
# A vendor model instead of Workers AI, for the CHAT only (embeddings stay on
# Workers AI: the column is sized to its model). Set, the chat is upstream's
# "openai/gpt-4o" through Vercel's AI Gateway (https://vercel.com/ai-gateway).
# In stage/prod this is a Worker secret the owner sets once per environment:
# `wrangler secret put AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY --name rag-chatbot-web-<env>`
# (README, "Use a vendor model instead").
# AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
